{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ashes Of Idunn: Tales Of Fimbulwinter",
    "steam_appid": 2997410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/2b546fcc32c6aebaced13ef00b016b79.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br><br><i>Far away from home, sailing through unknown waters. I ask the Gods to show me mercy.</i><br><i>My family, my people. Consumed by the tongues of fire. I never should have left them.</i><br><i>There may still be hope. They may still be, somewhere\u2026</i><br><i>Only she can help me find the way\u2026 the way home.</i><br><i>Gods give me strength, the strength to regain what I lost.</i><br><br>Ashes Of Idunn: Tales Of Fimbulwinter is a sneak peek into the future of the Ashes Of Idunn Metaverse. <br>In this experience, you will follow the Berserker into battle in search of his people. After the fight with the Troll, the Berserker seeks the Voelver to get answers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/a40364f496fc945fcf666d90d16537bc.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>The world of Tales Of Fimbulwinter is vast and offers different types of animal life and vegetation. <br>You can choose to explore the world freely but beware, some enemies might be camping around the corner.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/25fde2406c4ae3dfdda9dc2db6104418.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>Enemies will try to stop your search. Thankfully, with the power of the Gods and your mighty axe, you can defeat them in old-fashioned melee combat<br>But be careful, too many enemies at once may cause your demise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/50a487d05937bf57ce6eae2cf0d72264.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>Low on health? With some mix of natural ingredients found in the world and a little rest at the resting runes that will not be a problem for long. <br>These magical runes have the power of giving great comfort to our Berserker, this way, he is able to rest and regain his strength.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/74c276e5a40382d6d30471e607cc3765.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>The path may seem straightforward, but sometimes even the greatest need a guide. The runes will serve as a guide for your travels within this realm. <br>Just follow the runes and you will eventually find your way to the Voelver and your people.<br><br>Had fun with the experience and need more Ashes of Idunn? Do not fret, there is more to come...",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/2b546fcc32c6aebaced13ef00b016b79.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br><br><i>Far away from home, sailing through unknown waters. I ask the Gods to show me mercy.</i><br><i>My family, my people. Consumed by the tongues of fire. I never should have left them.</i><br><i>There may still be hope. They may still be, somewhere\u2026</i><br><i>Only she can help me find the way\u2026 the way home.</i><br><i>Gods give me strength, the strength to regain what I lost.</i><br><br>Ashes Of Idunn: Tales Of Fimbulwinter is a sneak peek into the future of the Ashes Of Idunn Metaverse. <br>In this experience, you will follow the Berserker into battle in search of his people. After the fight with the Troll, the Berserker seeks the Voelver to get answers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/a40364f496fc945fcf666d90d16537bc.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>The world of Tales Of Fimbulwinter is vast and offers different types of animal life and vegetation. <br>You can choose to explore the world freely but beware, some enemies might be camping around the corner.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/25fde2406c4ae3dfdda9dc2db6104418.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>Enemies will try to stop your search. Thankfully, with the power of the Gods and your mighty axe, you can defeat them in old-fashioned melee combat<br>But be careful, too many enemies at once may cause your demise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/50a487d05937bf57ce6eae2cf0d72264.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>Low on health? With some mix of natural ingredients found in the world and a little rest at the resting runes that will not be a problem for long. <br>These magical runes have the power of giving great comfort to our Berserker, this way, he is able to rest and regain his strength.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997410/extras/74c276e5a40382d6d30471e607cc3765.avif?t=1721412006\" width=600 height=480 /></span><br>The path may seem straightforward, but sometimes even the greatest need a guide. The runes will serve as a guide for your travels within this realm. <br>Just follow the runes and you will eventually find your way to the Voelver and your people.<br><br>Had fun with the experience and need more Ashes of Idunn? Do not fret, there is more to come...",
